{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24174","headline":"刘苏州以华亭一鹤远寄以诗谢之 · 白居易","name":"刘苏州以华亭一鹤远寄以诗谢之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老鹤风姿异，衰翁诗思深。\n素毛如我鬓，丹顶似君心。\n松际雪相映，鸡羣尘不侵。\n殷勤远来意，一只重千金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}